      text: <p><span style="color:#1E2761;font-size:14px;font-weight:700">5 级解码 · 每级通用 Pipeline</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 8d0eb583e9ff0f49c296a8d9abf769a41b299830b0b411c0af50e72c89a2e2f2
  - elementId: slide-29-node-713-Text-37
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 504
      - 172.8
      - 410.4
      - 316.8
    content:
      fontFamily: Consolas
      fontSize: 11
      color: '#1F2937'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">[L1 起点] x_c → FFC1 + FFC2 + residual → MultiscaleConvBlock</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">[每级通用模块 (L2~L4)]</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Consolas">    ① TransposedConvBlock ↑×2 (resize-conv 多分支)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Consolas">    ② FFC_H8 / FFC_H4 (仅 L2、L3)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Consolas">    ③ 三路先验调制:</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:9.5px;font-family:Consolas">      x = x · (1 + a·grad_gate(g)</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:9.5px;font-family:Consolas">             + b·joint_gate([g,x,s])</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:9.5px;font-family:Consolas">             + c·spec_lik_gate(s))</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Consolas">    ④ SpecularAwareAttention (sa1..sa4)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Consolas">    ⑤ Attention_block (对 ResNet skip 做门控)</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Consolas">    ⑥ cat(dec_feature, gated_skip, enh_i)</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">[L5 输出头]</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Consolas">    cat → output_reduce → output_dilated → residual → output_conv3</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Consolas">    → b_head (sigmoid) / r_direct_head (sigmoid) / alpha_logit</span></p>
    sourceLayout: e7b10d89a9f7aa97450f2aa8af1b49afa78d23bcbfb7795d680b9fa4218c8e43
